Create a beautiful, romantic, emotional 6-page website as a surprise gift for my boyfriend for Boyfriend Day.

The website should feel personal, cute, elegant and dreamy, with a soft pink/red romantic theme, smooth animations, floating hearts, beautiful typography and a mobile-friendly design.

PAGE 1 — WELCOME
Title: “Happy Boyfriend Day, My Love ❤️”
Subtitle: “A little surprise made just for you…”
Add a cute heart animation and a button: “Start Our Story →”

PAGE 2 — THIS OR THAT
Create an interactive “This or That?” game with cute choices:
• Hug 🫂 or Kiss 💋
• Call 📞 or Chat 💬
• Beach 🌊 or Movie 🎬
• Chocolate 🍫 or Ice Cream 🍦
• Morning ☀️ or Late Night 🌙
Make the choices animated and playful.
After choosing, show a cute message.

PAGE 3 — THINGS I LOVE ABOUT YOU
Create beautiful animated cards for:
• Your smile
• Your eyes
• Your voice
• The way you care
• The way you understand me
• The way you make me smile
Add a button to continue.

PAGE 4 — MEMORIES
Create a beautiful photo gallery where I can later upload our photos.
Each photo should have a small caption underneath.
Use romantic animations when photos appear.
Add placeholders for 6–8 photos.

PAGE 5 — A LETTER FOR YOU
Create an elegant letter section titled:
“A Letter For You 💌”
Use a paper/letter-style design.
Include space for a long personal message that I can edit later.
Add a subtle typing animation for the letter.

PAGE 6 — LAST SURPRISE
Start with:
“One Last Surprise… 👀”
Add a button:
“Tap For Your Surprise 🎁”
When clicked, show a beautiful heart animation, falling hearts/confetti and reveal:
“You are one of my favourite parts of my story. ❤️”
Then show:
“Happy Boyfriend Day, my favourite person. 🫂❤️”

IMPORTANT:
Make all 6 pages feel connected like one romantic story.
Use smooth page transitions.
Make everything responsive for mobile phones.
Keep the design classy, cute and emotional rather than childish.
Use HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
Keep the code clean and easy to edit later, especially the text and photo placeholders.
